From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grape <grape@invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:44:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tar: mark the version line as Grape's build

"bsdtar --version" now prints
  bsdtar 3.8.10-grape.1 - libarchive 3.8.10
(the trailing space is upstream's). Grape's sidecar gate refuses a
bsdtar whose version line has no "-grape" marker, so a stock bsdtar
can never be bundled by mistake. libarchive's own version string
(archive_version_string, archive_version_details) is unchanged.

[Grape-owned patch. Bump ".1" with every change to the patch series.]
---
 tar/bsdtar.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tar/bsdtar.c b/tar/bsdtar.c
index e91efa4..7b472b7 100644
--- a/tar/bsdtar.c
+++ b/tar/bsdtar.c
@@ -1080,7 +1080,7 @@ usage(void)
 static void
 version(void)
 {
-	printf("bsdtar %s - %s \n",
+	printf("bsdtar %s-grape.1 - %s \n",
 	    BSDTAR_VERSION_STRING,
 	    archive_version_details());
 	exit(0);
